        "SRC-001909"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "SF YIMBY names Van Meter Williams Pollack as residential architect and STUDIOS Architecture for core and shell.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-001909"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "APN 052-373-120 (no situs address, adjoining 603 Jefferson to the east) is owned by Redwood City Elem School Dist; the state report lists 750 Bradford under APN 52373120. APN 052-373-040 (603 Jefferson) is owned by SI 57 LLC, attn. The Sobrato Org LLC.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-004269",
        "SRC-004268",
        "SRC-001117"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "2021 submission as described: two seven-story buildings on a shared podium; units from studios to three bedrooms, 62 one- or two-bedroom and 6 three-bedroom; 574 spaces required, in-lieu fee proposed for 311.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-004267"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Earlier proposal on 603 Jefferson (2015): Pauls Corp proposed an eight-story building with 92 condos and about 4,500 sq ft of ground-floor retail, designed by BDE Architecture.",
